# Python preset for gh skim.

# Lock files resolved by the tool, not written by hand.
**/poetry.lock
**/Pipfile.lock
**/uv.lock

# Generated protobuf and gRPC stubs.
**/*_pb2.py
**/*_pb2.pyi
**/*_pb2_grpc.py

# Caches and compiled artefacts that occasionally get committed.
**/__pycache__/**

# Note: database migrations are deliberately NOT here. They are generated, but
# they can drop columns, and someone has to read that.
